        "description": "A curated daily report: today's biggest up-moves in volatility and biggest moves in skew over the\nliquid options universe (reliably adjusted and cleaned for liquidity and outliers via the anomaly\nuniverse), plus the top net-premium flow, the market tide, and the day's catalysts. One call for\nthe whole digest. Defaults to the last market day; pass `date` for a point-in-time report.\n",
